WEBVTT

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:19.200
<i>C'mon, morning's here--time to be on our way</i>

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:24.700
<i>Smiling faces, courage,</i>
<i>we're bustin' out: glory days!</i>

00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:29.830
<i>You ready or not? Ready or not, go!</i>
<i>No turning back: this trip is nonfiction</i>

00:00:29.830 --> 00:00:35.080
<i>You ready or not? Ready or not, go!</i>
<i>It's now or never, the real deal: Ready, and... action!</i>

00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:40.540
<i>Harsh winds that make us hesitate,</i>
<i>nights spent crying our eyes out</i>

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:45.790
<i>They're not necessarily bad things (not bad)</i>

00:00:45.790 --> 00:00:51.500
<i>Just like the power in a spring:</i>
<i>the harder we're pushed</i>

00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:55.040
<i>The higher we can fly</i>

00:00:55.040 --> 00:01:05.580
<i>Face the far-off distance</i>
<i>and aim for the horizon: rising sun</i>

00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:10.870
<i>Holding our hands up to that morning sun</i>

00:01:10.870 --> 00:01:21.250
<i>Our shared feelings brought us together--</i>
<i>we're not alone anymore</i>

00:01:21.250 --> 00:01:27.450
<i>And so we're on this brilliant voyage</i>

00:01:27.450 --> 00:01:34.250
<i>Smiling faces, courage,</i>
<i>we're bustin' out: glory days!</i>

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:43.250
And...

00:01:43.250 --> 00:01:46.000
...then what happened?

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:48.540
I was put onto the marketeers' horse cart.

00:01:48.540 --> 00:01:53.160
But I have few memories of
what happened around then.

00:01:53.160 --> 00:01:54.370
I was dreaming...

00:01:57.080 --> 00:02:00.620
...horrible dreams.

00:02:35.330 --> 00:02:38.000
<i>Who's</i> going to be King, now?

00:02:44.250 --> 00:02:46.290
<i>Who's</i> going to be King?

00:02:47.870 --> 00:02:48.870
Who is it?

00:02:59.700 --> 00:03:01.120
You're awake?

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:04.580
It's you...

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:24.000
"Sei and Shi Ka"

00:03:24.750 --> 00:03:26.580
What's wrong?!

00:03:26.580 --> 00:03:30.700
Please, please! Calm yourself, my lord!

00:03:30.700 --> 00:03:34.120
You must be frightened to wake up
and find yourself on a horse cart!

00:03:34.120 --> 00:03:37.500
I can explain--please let me explain!

00:03:37.500 --> 00:03:39.500
Calm yourself, my lord, please!

00:03:42.580 --> 00:03:44.700
And that's where we stand.

00:03:44.700 --> 00:03:47.950
We are plotting your mother's
return by a different route.

00:03:47.950 --> 00:03:52.330
Do not worry--you will surely
be reunited in Kanyou.

00:03:52.330 --> 00:03:57.790
We still have a ways to go
before the gate. Rest a while longer.

00:03:59.120 --> 00:04:01.870
And you can reach the gate like this?

00:04:01.870 --> 00:04:03.790
It's the best way.

00:04:03.790 --> 00:04:07.080
We're taking our usual road
to avoid arousing suspicion.

00:04:07.080 --> 00:04:11.700
It passes through five gates
on our way out of Sho.

00:04:11.700 --> 00:04:15.000
Once we're past those,
we'll be cleared for Chin.

00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:17.080
Five, eh?

00:04:17.080 --> 00:04:19.700
W-We were prepared for this, but...

00:04:19.700 --> 00:04:22.700
...you <i>do</i> have a way to get us
past the inspectors, right?

00:04:22.700 --> 00:04:27.450
Pfft. Leave that to us.

00:04:27.450 --> 00:04:30.080
Five gates till Chin...

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:32.410
No need to worry.

00:04:32.410 --> 00:04:36.540
Shi Ka will get you to Chin safe and sound.

00:04:44.330 --> 00:04:47.000
Is this real?

00:04:47.000 --> 00:04:49.290
Of course it is.

00:04:53.520 --> 00:04:57.480
"First Gate: Ta Ji (rice field)"

00:05:16.200 --> 00:05:17.790
All right, here we go!

00:05:17.790 --> 00:05:22.410
There's an empty rice bundle.
Lord Sei, you go in there.

00:05:22.410 --> 00:05:25.700
I'll take the reins.

00:05:25.700 --> 00:05:28.080
Next! And hurry it up!

00:05:28.080 --> 00:05:29.700
C'mon--next!

00:05:29.700 --> 00:05:31.830
What kind of cargo is this?!

00:05:31.830 --> 00:05:34.540
Gold coins? Grab him!

00:05:34.540 --> 00:05:38.700
Huh? No! It's not--please, don't!

00:05:46.200 --> 00:05:48.040
All right, next!

00:06:02.370 --> 00:06:03.450
Thanks again!

00:06:03.450 --> 00:06:05.620
Yep! Go on through!

00:06:11.540 --> 00:06:13.160
Okay, next!

00:06:24.580 --> 00:06:28.410
Wh-What was that?!
That's all it takes to pass?

00:06:28.410 --> 00:06:32.160
Us black marketeers deal in illegal goods.

00:06:32.160 --> 00:06:37.000
We must always, always be prepared.

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:38.870
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:06:38.870 --> 00:06:42.410
Not all black marketeers
can slip through like that.

00:06:42.410 --> 00:06:44.620
She can, 'cause she's Shi Ka.

00:06:44.620 --> 00:06:50.330
After she took over,
our business grew to twice the size.

00:06:52.700 --> 00:06:55.120
Just good business sense!

00:06:55.120 --> 00:06:59.000
Ryo Fui recommended these youngsters...

00:06:59.000 --> 00:07:03.000
I had my doubts, but now I understand.

00:07:13.950 --> 00:07:18.250
Now that I get a good look at him,
he's just a mess of bruises.

00:07:18.250 --> 00:07:20.250
It must be a daily thing...

00:07:23.290 --> 00:07:24.750
Lord Sei?

00:07:29.160 --> 00:07:44.000
Can't breathe... Can't breathe... The pain...

00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:46.660
Don't go... We won't let you, Sei...

00:07:46.660 --> 00:07:50.160
To the depths of the earth
with you... Can't breathe...

00:07:50.160 --> 00:07:51.910
As if we'd let you go...

00:07:51.910 --> 00:07:56.750
The depths of the earth...
The depths of the earth...

00:07:56.750 --> 00:08:01.910
Shut up! I had nothing to do
with Changping! I'm going back to Chin!

00:08:01.910 --> 00:08:05.500
Doing what...? To Chin...?

00:08:05.500 --> 00:08:11.080
Who is...? Who is...?
Doing what...? Going back...?

00:08:11.080 --> 00:08:13.500
Back to Chin--and then what?

00:08:16.950 --> 00:08:18.620
You're kidding, right?

00:08:21.870 --> 00:08:24.700
After all, you're already--

00:08:27.500 --> 00:08:28.020
What happened?!

00:08:28.080 --> 00:08:29.750
Not again!

00:08:30.950 --> 00:08:32.330
Lord Sei!

00:08:38.040 --> 00:08:41.910
So Lord Sei is acting strange?

00:08:41.910 --> 00:08:45.870
Anyone can be tormented by dreams.

00:08:45.870 --> 00:08:50.370
He's likely still a bit confused
by his sudden change in circumstances.

00:08:50.370 --> 00:08:51.700
But...

00:08:51.700 --> 00:08:55.330
Regardless, we must first escape Sho.

00:08:55.330 --> 00:08:57.290
And only that, Shi Ka.

00:08:59.350 --> 00:09:03.350
"Second Gate: 
Qing Guo"

00:09:00.250 --> 00:09:03.160
Another gate. Into the bundle, Lord Sei.

00:09:08.870 --> 00:09:12.200
So getting out of Sho comes first, huh?

00:09:12.200 --> 00:09:13.750
That's true, but...

00:09:20.080 --> 00:09:21.500
Hey, nice!

00:09:22.620 --> 00:09:24.950
Oho, Shi Ka! It's Shi Ka!

00:09:24.950 --> 00:09:26.700
It's been so long!

00:09:26.700 --> 00:09:29.160
You look well, Mo Ei.

00:09:29.160 --> 00:09:34.120
Haven't seen ya 'round lately.
Ya weren't avoidin' me, now, were ya?

00:09:34.120 --> 00:09:37.000
I would never!

00:09:37.000 --> 00:09:40.000
Rest here a while, eh? I'll get some tea.

00:09:40.000 --> 00:09:42.750
I'd love to, but we're in a bit of a hurry...

00:09:42.750 --> 00:09:45.410
Too bad! Spend some time with me for once!

00:09:45.410 --> 00:09:50.000
Or I'll just order a cargo inspection
and <i>make</i> you stay!

00:09:50.000 --> 00:09:52.660
I certainly wouldn't want that...

00:09:52.660 --> 00:10:03.040
But there are customers waiting,
so let's have that tea another--

00:10:03.040 --> 00:10:05.370
Hey!

00:10:05.370 --> 00:10:07.450
Wh-What're ya doin'?!

00:10:07.450 --> 00:10:09.580
Me? Doing some test shots!

00:10:09.580 --> 00:10:11.000
Bought this bow yesterday

00:10:11.000 --> 00:10:12.950
and thought I'd try it out on a bundle of rice.

00:10:12.950 --> 00:10:14.790
Cut that out, dammit!

00:10:14.790 --> 00:10:20.160
Don't be angry, Shi Ka! This guy's brand-new!

00:10:20.160 --> 00:10:22.580
G-Go on, now...

00:10:26.870 --> 00:10:28.080
Blood?!

00:10:34.830 --> 00:10:40.160
I haven't heard any screams
or whimpers since we left the gate...

00:10:40.160 --> 00:10:42.790
Has he passed out? Or is he...

00:10:48.620 --> 00:10:49.620
Lord Sei!

00:10:52.160 --> 00:10:56.500
Pull out the arrow. I can't get out.

00:10:56.500 --> 00:10:58.790
Lord Sei! You're all right!

00:10:58.790 --> 00:11:01.910
And you endured that without a single word!

00:11:01.910 --> 00:11:03.540
Hang on...

00:11:03.540 --> 00:11:07.200
What child wouldn't cry
as an arrow pierces his arm?

00:11:07.200 --> 00:11:08.830
H-Here I go...

00:11:13.580 --> 00:11:15.790
What human wouldn't even blink an eye

00:11:15.790 --> 00:11:19.700
as that arrow is pulled from his arm?

00:11:19.700 --> 00:11:21.540
What's <i>with</i> this child?

00:11:25.830 --> 00:11:31.540
Hardship in your younger years
can suppress your emotions.

00:11:31.540 --> 00:11:36.950
We war orphans were the same
until our adopted father took us in.

00:11:36.950 --> 00:11:42.750
But to not budge after taking an arrow?
That goes beyond mere emotions.

00:11:42.750 --> 00:11:45.790
The boy is clearly not normal.

00:11:45.790 --> 00:11:49.540
Something's going on in his body and mind...

00:11:52.310 --> 00:11:56.020
"Kou Shou"

00:11:52.480 --> 00:11:56.020
"A Mon"

00:11:57.620 --> 00:12:00.120
It was four days after Shi Ka
and her crew left Kantan.

00:12:00.120 --> 00:12:05.290
At last they arrived at the
fifth and final gate, Ro Kan.

00:12:05.290 --> 00:12:08.450
Once past Ro Kan, it was a
half-day's distance to the border

00:12:08.450 --> 00:12:10.120
between Chin and Sho.

00:12:11.910 --> 00:12:14.700
Is something wrong?

00:12:14.700 --> 00:12:17.540
The moon's out again.

00:12:17.540 --> 00:12:20.410
That it is.

00:12:20.410 --> 00:12:25.200
I like your eyes when you're
looking at the moon, Lord Sei.

00:12:25.200 --> 00:12:29.500
Sometimes I can't tell dream from reality.

00:12:29.500 --> 00:12:32.950
That must be rough.

00:12:32.950 --> 00:12:37.410
Just remember that when I'm here, it's real.

00:12:37.410 --> 00:12:38.410
Shi Ka...

00:12:40.790 --> 00:12:43.540
Can I really go back to Chin?

00:12:46.120 --> 00:12:48.540
It's like I said before:

00:12:48.540 --> 00:12:50.910
I'm taking you back, period.

00:12:54.160 --> 00:12:58.090
"Final Gate: 
Ro Kan"

00:12:55.000 --> 00:12:57.620
You may pass!

00:13:00.910 --> 00:13:02.330
Hang on!

00:13:04.500 --> 00:13:06.910
What's going on here, Shi Ka?

00:13:06.910 --> 00:13:09.250
I don't recognize half these people!

00:13:09.250 --> 00:13:11.450
Who are they, huh?

00:13:11.450 --> 00:13:16.000
We were short a few, so I hired them
in a village along the way.

00:13:16.000 --> 00:13:19.910
They may be older,
but they're of no use to me at all!

00:13:19.910 --> 00:13:22.950
In fact, they're just weighing me down.

00:13:22.950 --> 00:13:24.290
I'll just leave them here,

00:13:24.290 --> 00:13:27.290
and you can put them on the next cart out.

00:13:30.200 --> 00:13:33.370
Ugh! Fine, fine! Get outta the
way already! Off with you!

00:13:38.700 --> 00:13:41.040
<i>That</i> was a close one!

00:13:43.870 --> 00:13:45.000
A smoke signal!

00:13:45.000 --> 00:13:48.200
It's the signal for an emergency lockdown!
Close the gate!

00:13:48.200 --> 00:13:49.450
Close the gate!

00:13:53.000 --> 00:13:54.910
The gate's shut!

00:13:54.910 --> 00:13:56.620
Have they found out about Lord Sei?

00:13:56.620 --> 00:14:00.450
M-Made it by a hair...

00:14:00.450 --> 00:14:04.950
We did it! We made it in time--
past all the gates!

00:14:04.950 --> 00:14:07.750
Now we can get back to Chin!

00:14:07.750 --> 00:14:10.500
This is no time for rejoicing!

00:14:10.500 --> 00:14:14.580
If they find out about Sei,
they'll be after us in a heartbeat!

00:14:14.580 --> 00:14:16.410
With their whole army!

00:14:16.410 --> 00:14:20.540
They're right. No need for disguises now.

00:14:20.540 --> 00:14:22.160
We'll find a good place to dump our cargo,

00:14:22.160 --> 00:14:24.830
then it's full speed ahead to the border!

00:14:24.830 --> 00:14:26.950
The Sho cavalry is fast, gentlemen!

00:14:31.500 --> 00:14:33.830
Our rendezvous point is just ahead.

00:14:33.830 --> 00:14:36.370
There should already be
troops there waiting for us.

00:14:36.370 --> 00:14:40.540
No signs we're being followed.
We can go right through!

00:14:40.540 --> 00:14:42.830
Shi Ka, you really saved us.

00:14:42.830 --> 00:14:46.000
Things would never have gone
this smoothly without your help.

00:14:46.000 --> 00:14:47.580
We thank you!

00:14:47.580 --> 00:14:51.200
Saved you, eh?

00:14:51.200 --> 00:14:53.950
But have I truly saved this child?

00:14:57.700 --> 00:15:00.580
You'll be home soon, Lord Sei.

00:15:00.580 --> 00:15:06.450
Just think: once you become King,
you'll be in the lap of luxury!

00:15:06.450 --> 00:15:09.700
If I were ten years younger,
I could be your wife,

00:15:09.700 --> 00:15:11.290
living the high life with you!

00:15:11.290 --> 00:15:16.790
Maybe "wife" is a bit much.
Concubine? No, wait...

00:15:16.790 --> 00:15:19.410
Servant? Hee hee!

00:15:21.580 --> 00:15:24.120
Lord Sei? Are you all right?

00:15:24.120 --> 00:15:26.660
Lord Sei...? Lord Sei?

00:15:26.660 --> 00:15:27.700
Wait...

00:15:31.700 --> 00:15:35.620
Just... hang on...

00:15:35.620 --> 00:15:39.120
Sei... Sei...

00:15:39.120 --> 00:15:41.290
<i>Who's</i> going to be King, now?

00:15:41.290 --> 00:15:44.580
<i>Who's</i> going to be King?

00:15:44.580 --> 00:15:46.330
Who is it?

00:15:46.330 --> 00:15:50.950
Sei... Sei... Sei...

00:15:50.950 --> 00:15:55.000
Going back to Chin to be King?

00:15:55.000 --> 00:15:57.000
You must be dreaming.

00:15:58.830 --> 00:16:02.080
Enough of this nonsense. Get off the cart.

00:16:02.080 --> 00:16:04.540
You can't go to Chin.

00:16:04.540 --> 00:16:05.500
Shut up!

00:16:05.500 --> 00:16:09.500
Lord Sei?! What's the matter? Lord Sei!

00:16:09.500 --> 00:16:13.410
Who'll celebrate your homecoming?

00:16:13.410 --> 00:16:16.000
Who? Your father?

00:16:16.000 --> 00:16:19.750
Don't make me laugh.
He tossed you aside seven years ago

00:16:19.750 --> 00:16:22.080
when he came back to Chin.

00:16:22.080 --> 00:16:26.700
Even your mother has shunned you.
If not for you,

00:16:26.700 --> 00:16:29.330
she could have gone back
to being a lady of Sho!

00:16:29.330 --> 00:16:31.330
If not for you...

00:16:31.330 --> 00:16:34.910
--Stop it! Stop--stop it!
--Lord Sei! What's wrong, Lord Sei?

00:16:37.330 --> 00:16:40.410
Discarded by your father,
shunned by your mother...

00:16:40.410 --> 00:16:44.000
If you go back now,
you'll only be a nuisance.

00:16:44.000 --> 00:16:47.500
There's no place for you in Chin.

00:16:47.500 --> 00:16:54.500
But the biggest problem... is you.
Your mind, your body.

00:16:54.500 --> 00:16:58.200
A normal person isn't so blasé
when he's shot with an arrow--

00:16:58.200 --> 00:17:00.950
a <i>sane</i> person, that is!

00:17:00.950 --> 00:17:04.290
You're smart;
you must have realized long ago:

00:17:04.290 --> 00:17:08.700
Someone like <i>you</i> could <i>never</i> be King!

00:17:08.700 --> 00:17:11.450
So how long are you going
to stay on that cart, huh?

00:17:11.450 --> 00:17:13.120
Get down off there, now!

00:17:17.750 --> 00:17:18.870
Sei's fallen off!

00:17:18.870 --> 00:17:19.580
What?!

00:17:19.580 --> 00:17:20.580
Stop!

00:17:23.040 --> 00:17:24.290
I'll get him!

00:17:24.290 --> 00:17:25.750
Everyone else, wait there!

00:17:25.750 --> 00:17:27.200
Shi Ka!

00:17:27.200 --> 00:17:29.080
Oh, man... what's goin' on?

00:17:29.080 --> 00:17:30.660
Like I know!

00:17:30.660 --> 00:17:33.330
That brat... We're running outta time here!

00:17:35.790 --> 00:17:36.700
Lord Sei!

00:17:36.700 --> 00:17:39.250
Stay back!

00:17:39.250 --> 00:17:42.330
I... I can't go back to Chin.

00:17:42.330 --> 00:17:45.790
What do you mean? You'll be there soon.

00:17:45.790 --> 00:17:47.660
But I can't. There's a reason.

00:17:53.700 --> 00:17:55.330
What are you doing?!

00:17:55.330 --> 00:17:56.870
Are you in your right mind?!

00:17:59.290 --> 00:18:00.830
There's no pain!

00:18:05.200 --> 00:18:12.370
And it's not just pain.
Flavors. Smells. Heat. Cold.

00:18:12.370 --> 00:18:16.450
I feel <i>nothing</i> --nothing at all.

00:18:16.450 --> 00:18:19.750
That's absurd...

00:18:19.750 --> 00:18:22.540
Someone like that could never be King.

00:18:24.540 --> 00:18:28.000
But how...

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:32.120
Ever since I can remember,
I knew I was royalty,

00:18:32.120 --> 00:18:35.290
and my heart trembled
with the sheer luck and honor of it.

00:18:35.290 --> 00:18:40.410
But one step outside and I was
in the middle of a hostile land.

00:18:40.410 --> 00:18:44.750
Worse, the land whose 400 thousand
soldiers Chin had slaughtered

00:18:44.750 --> 00:18:46.370
at Chouhei.

00:18:49.000 --> 00:18:53.540
The animosity toward Chin
rained down upon me without mercy.

00:18:53.540 --> 00:18:56.750
While enduring that overwhelming violence,

00:18:56.750 --> 00:19:03.410
I saw the situation in which
I had been placed... and despaired.

00:19:03.410 --> 00:19:07.870
As the days of abuse continued,
my heart closed even more tightly,

00:19:07.870 --> 00:19:11.080
until eventually I could feel nothing at all.

00:19:14.290 --> 00:19:16.290
How awful...

00:19:16.290 --> 00:19:20.250
To think he was driven to such extremes...

00:19:20.250 --> 00:19:22.290
And to think...

00:19:22.290 --> 00:19:26.700
This child, this prince of Chin,
was born in Sho.

00:19:26.700 --> 00:19:29.910
Because of that ill fortune,
wholly beyond his control...

00:19:32.580 --> 00:19:36.410
he was made to bear the brunt
of their Changping grudge.

00:19:36.410 --> 00:19:39.830
A child, not yet ten, to whom
no one held out a helping hand,

00:19:39.830 --> 00:19:43.000
left all alone... this whole time.

00:19:45.500 --> 00:19:48.580
You <i>can</i> be King.

00:19:48.580 --> 00:19:51.410
I'll make sure of it.

00:19:51.410 --> 00:19:55.540
If you have no pain, I'll feel it for you!

00:19:55.540 --> 00:19:58.910
Flavors, smells--all of it!

00:19:58.910 --> 00:20:02.700
But... it's all right.

00:20:02.700 --> 00:20:06.000
You can feel just fine.

00:20:06.000 --> 00:20:11.750
That night... weren't we both
moved by the moon's glow?

00:20:11.750 --> 00:20:17.370
It's all right. I'm with you.
We'll go back to Chin together.

00:20:20.830 --> 00:20:21.910
This is ridiculous!

00:20:21.910 --> 00:20:23.700
I got negotiatin' to do!

00:20:23.700 --> 00:20:26.080
The gate's closed? Since when?

00:20:26.080 --> 00:20:28.040
Who's responsible for this?!

00:20:28.040 --> 00:20:30.660
It's the Yellow Pennant!
Those are the King's horses!

00:20:30.660 --> 00:20:31.910
What?!

00:20:31.910 --> 00:20:35.750
Who's in charge here? Show yourself!

00:20:35.750 --> 00:20:38.410
It is I. What might this be concerning?

00:20:38.410 --> 00:20:41.200
Did a merchant named Shi Ka pass through here?

00:20:41.200 --> 00:20:43.660
Y-Yes--about twelve hours ago.

00:20:43.660 --> 00:20:45.700
Open the gate at once!

00:20:48.000 --> 00:20:49.290
The cavalry!

00:20:49.290 --> 00:20:50.450
Wow!

00:20:50.450 --> 00:20:52.870
Is there a battle on the way?

00:20:52.870 --> 00:20:56.120
That Shi Ka... What's she done now?

00:21:00.750 --> 00:21:01.750
Come, now.

00:21:06.200 --> 00:21:10.330
Lord Sei! Are you all right?

00:21:10.330 --> 00:21:12.290
What's with her?

00:21:12.290 --> 00:21:16.450
Sei's not going back.
Sei's not going back.

00:21:16.450 --> 00:21:18.700
What's with her?

00:21:18.700 --> 00:21:20.790
You can't have him.

00:21:20.790 --> 00:21:23.700
We'll take him away.

00:21:23.700 --> 00:21:26.910
To the depths of the earth with us...

00:21:26.910 --> 00:21:29.330
Don't meddle, woman.

00:21:29.330 --> 00:21:32.000
Or we'll take you, too.

00:21:32.000 --> 00:21:34.870
Take you to the depths of the earth...

00:21:34.870 --> 00:21:36.080
Get away from me, Shi Ka!

00:21:36.080 --> 00:21:39.330
The ghosts who possess me are after you, too!

00:21:39.330 --> 00:21:40.330
Ghosts?

00:22:01.080 --> 00:22:04.040
It's no use after all, Shi Ka...

00:22:04.040 --> 00:22:07.250
There's... There's no escaping them.

00:22:18.410 --> 00:22:21.410
Pull yourself together!
There's no such thing as ghosts!

00:22:21.410 --> 00:22:23.080
None of that is real!

00:22:23.080 --> 00:22:25.700
There's no one with you now but me!

00:22:25.700 --> 00:22:27.450
Those are all just illusions!

00:23:02.540 --> 00:23:05.250
So warm...

00:23:05.250 --> 00:23:11.200
That's right--this is new, this warmth.

00:23:11.200 --> 00:23:15.910
It's the first time I've ever had anyone

00:23:15.910 --> 00:23:17.870
hold me like this...

00:23:48.830 --> 00:23:51.750
<i>What do you think?</i>

00:23:51.750 --> 00:23:54.830
<i>Why would the voice that melted into the sky</i>

00:23:54.830 --> 00:23:59.450
<i>Peel away and disappear?</i>

00:24:00.790 --> 00:24:03.790
<i>Just a single word</i>

00:24:03.790 --> 00:24:06.830
<i>If that's all you'd say</i>

00:24:06.830 --> 00:24:11.700
<i>What kind of word would you choose?</i>

00:24:12.540 --> 00:24:15.910
<i>Holding my breath and making sure</i>

00:24:15.910 --> 00:24:18.870
<i>The heartbeat can't wait</i>

00:24:18.870 --> 00:24:24.830
<i>If I let go of your hand, I'll want even more</i>

00:24:24.830 --> 00:24:28.450
<i>And so I keep on doing this</i>

00:24:28.450 --> 00:24:30.910
<i>Not allowing myself to stop</i>

00:24:30.910 --> 00:24:35.700
<i>Because I'm still searching for answers</i>

00:24:35.700 --> 00:24:39.370
<i>I want you to tell me</i>

00:24:41.700 --> 00:24:46.200
<i>Before you melt away into the sky</i>

00:24:52.000 --> 00:24:58.010
"Next Episode Preview"

00:25:02.000 --> 00:25:07.020
"Connecting Wishes"
